# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — conanbuild PATH 缺 hnp 工具目录，ar/ranlib 探测失败退化为 link -lib ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-27
# Software: libyubikey 1.13（所有需要静态库的 autotools 包）
# Gate: conan create build() / configure libtool 探测
# Status: UNMATCHED — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry

id:                     E2796
title: checking for ar... no → checking the archiver (link -lib) interface... unknown → could not determine link -lib interface
trigger_tool: autoconf / configure / libtool
phase: configuration
error_signature: checking for ar\.\.\. no|checking the archiver \(link -lib\) interface\.\.\. unknown|configure: error: could not determine link -lib interface
severity:               2
category:               autotools, toolchain, conan
match_keywords: checking for ar, link -lib, could not determine link -lib interface,
  checking for ranlib, archiver interface
root_cause: profile 以绝对路径注入 CC/CXX（hnp clang），configure 的编译器探测
  直接通过；但 conanbuild 聚合 PATH 不含 hnp bin（有 make/awk，来自 ~/usr/local/bin
  与系统目录），裸名 ar/ranlib 无法解析。autoconf 探测不到 ar 时回退到 MSVC 风格
  `link -lib` archiver 探测，在 OHOS 上 interface 探测必然 unknown 而 abort。
  编译器探测通过不代表 binutils 可达，两者是独立失败点。
rec_approach: prepend-toolchain-bin-to-path
verification_cmd:
  r4 shadow CI 全绿（L0/L1/L2/L5 pass，exit 0，run
  codex-1.13-libyubikey-1.13-20260927-conan-20260927-150715-23005）。
rec_auto_fix:               false
rec_impl:               manual
rec_priority:               1
last_updated:               2026-10-19
authors:               unknown
doc_file:               doc/E2796.md
affected_scope:         checking for ar... no → checking the archiver (link -lib) in
verification_cmd:       # 以 source_pr CI 门禁为准（PR n/a）
rec_description:        prepend-toolchain-bin-to-path
